1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Can decision models make useful traffic-signal choices compared with an optimizer?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Five saved SUMO replays share one clock. The same 78-car demand is used for every controller.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Counters show completion, remaining demand, and time in system. Remaining includes future scheduled cars.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The revised objective adds 10 times the final modeled queue. Planning horizon: 15 seconds.

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,960
Changing the objective changed controller behavior, but did not improve every controller. One seed; early results.
